# ltpadmin(1) startup for the EARTH node (Mission Control): LTP engine 23.
# One span, to the LUNAR GATEWAY (engine 50). Segments for engine 50 are sent
# to the link emulator port for earth->gateway (127.0.0.1:22350), which
# forwards them to the gateway's udplsi (127.0.0.1:15013).
#   a span <peer> <max export sessions> <max import sessions> <max segment size>
#          <aggregation size threshold> <aggregation time limit> '<LSO cmd>' [<queuing latency>]
# Aggregation size threshold 1 byte: every bundle is sent as its own LTP block
# as soon as ltpclo dequeues it, so a small bundle never waits for the
# aggregation time limit (1 s, checked once per second by ltpclock) at each
# hop. Bundles not yet dequeued wait in the BP egress plan's queues (bulk,
# standard, urgent). At most 32 blocks (export sessions) per span are open
# at a time.
1 64
a span 50 32 32 1024 1 1 'udplso 127.0.0.1:22350' 1
a seat 'udplsi 127.0.0.1:12313'
s
